Package: cangjie-compiler
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         llvm (>= 14.0),
         libclang-cpp14
Description: Cangjie programming language compiler
 Cangjie is a general-purpose programming language designed for
 full-scenario application development. It balances development
 efficiency and runtime performance while providing a good
 programming experience.
 .
 This package contains the Cangjie compiler (cjc) and related
 command-line tools for compiling Cangjie source code.

Package: cangjie-compiler-headers
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Cangjie programming language compiler header files
 Cangjie is a general-purpose programming language designed for
 full-scenario application development.
 .
 This package contains the C/C++ header files for the Cangjie
 compiler, which are needed if you want to develop applications
 that integrate with the Cangjie compiler infrastructure.
